<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>每日選股報告</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, "Noto Sans TC", sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 16px; background: #f7f7f8; color: #222; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .meta { color: #666; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .tabs { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .tab-btn { padding: 8px 16px; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 6px; background: #fff; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .tab-btn.active { background: #2a5adf; color: #fff; border-color: #2a5adf; }
  .tab-panel { display: none; overflow-x: auto; }
  .tab-panel.active { display: block; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; background: #fff; min-width: 640px; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 6px 10px; font-size: 0.9rem; text-align: right; }
  th { background: #eef1f8; }
  td.name, th.name { text-align: left; }
  .note { color: #999; font-size: 0.8rem; }
  .badges { display: flex; gap: 3px; justify-content: flex-start; }
  .badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 20px; height: 18px; padding: 0 3px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.7rem; background: #eee; color: #bbb; }
  .badge.on { background: #2a5adf; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
  .badge.on:hover { background: #1a3fae; }
  .empty { color: #888; padding: 16px 0; }
  footer { margin-top: 24px; color: #888; font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.6; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>每日選股報告</h1>
<div class="meta">產生時間：{{ generated_at.strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M") }}（台灣時間）</div>

<div class="tabs">
{% for w in windows %}
  <button class="tab-btn{% if loop.first %} active{% endif %}" data-target="w{{ w }}">{{ w }}日</button>
{% endfor %}
</div>

{% for w in windows %}
<section class="tab-panel{% if loop.first %} active{% endif %}" id="w{{ w }}">
  {% set rows = results.get(w, []) %}
  {% if rows %}
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>排名</th>
        <th class="name">代號</th>
        <th class="name">名稱</th>
        <th>{{ w }}日累積成交值</th>
        <th>營收新高</th>
        <th>較前次高點</th>
        <th>YoY</th>
        <th>毛利率</th>
        <th class="name">最新營收月份</th>
        <th class="name">上榜區間</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for r in rows %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ r.rank }}</td>
        <td class="name">{{ r.code }}</td>
        <td class="name">{{ r.name }}</td>
        <td>{{ "{:,.0f}".format(r.total_trading_value) }}{% if r.insufficient_history %} <span class="note">(資料不足 {{ r.days_available }}/{{ w }}日)</span>{% endif %}</td>
        <td>{{ r.revenue_label }}</td>
        <td>{% if r.pct_above_prior_record is not none %}{{ "{:+.1f}%".format(r.pct_above_prior_record) }}{% else %}-{% endif %}</td>
        <td>{% if r.yoy_pct is not none %}{{ "{:+.1f}%".format(r.yoy_pct) }}{% else %}-{% endif %}</td>
        <td>{% if r.gross_margin_pct is not none %}{{ "{:.1f}%".format(r.gross_margin_pct) }}{% else %}-{% endif %}</td>
        <td class="name">{{ r.revenue_month }}</td>
        <td class="name">
          <div class="badges">
            {% for w2 in windows %}
            {% if w2 in r.on_windows %}
            <span class="badge on" data-target="w{{ w2 }}" title="也上榜 {{ w2 }}日">{{ w2 }}</span>
            {% else %}
            <span class="badge">{{ w2 }}</span>
            {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  {% else %}
  <div class="empty">今日無符合條件的公司。</div>
  {% endif %}
</section>
{% endfor %}

<footer>
  <div>選股邏輯：先取近N個交易日累積成交值前30大，再篩選最新月營收至少為近1年新高者。</div>
  <div>營收歷史資料回溯至{% if earliest_revenue_roc_year %} {{ earliest_revenue_roc_year + 1911 }} 年（民國{{ earliest_revenue_roc_year }}年）{% else %}目前累積的範圍{% endif %}，「史上新高」係指此範圍內的最高紀錄。</div>
  <div>10/15/30日等較長區間的資料自本系統上線起逐日累積，累積天數不足時以實際可取得天數計算平均值並標註。</div>
</footer>

<script>
(function () {
  var buttons = document.querySelectorAll(".tab-btn");
  var panels = document.querySelectorAll(".tab-panel");
  function activate(id) {
    buttons.forEach(function (b) { b.classList.toggle("active", b.dataset.target === id); });
    panels.forEach(function (p) { p.classList.toggle("active", p.id === id); });
  }
  buttons.forEach(function (b) {
    b.addEventListener("click", function () {
      activate(b.dataset.target);
      history.replaceState(null, "", "#" + b.dataset.target);
    });
  });
  document.querySelectorAll(".badge.on[data-target]").forEach(function (b) {
    b.addEventListener("click", function () {
      activate(b.dataset.target);
      history.replaceState(null, "", "#" + b.dataset.target);
    });
  });
  if (location.hash) {
    var target = location.hash.slice(1);
    if (document.getElementById(target)) activate(target);
  }
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
